Problem Statement/Industry
Problem Being Solved
Many smartphone users, especially those with low-end and mid-
range phones, struggle to capture stable, well-framed,
professional-looking photos and videos. Shaky footage, poor
framing, inconsistent focus, and dependence on user skill or
expensive devices make quality content creation difficult.Supporting Data
